[en.FOCUS_C08_OLD_FRIENDS]
Old Friends

[en.FOCUS_C08_OLD_FRIENDS_desc]
After the Ultimate Battle, the School of Friendship was abandoned, and foreign students were driven out of Equestria by Cozy Glow. Now that we have a radio, can we send messages to the former students and call them to rise up against Cozy Glow with us?

[en.FOCUS_C08_OLD_FRIENDS_TOOLTIP]
We can contact the former students of the School of Friendship and more friends through §YStarlight Radio§!\nUnlock decision in §YStarlight Radio§!: §YContact Former Students§!\nUnlock decision in §YStarlight Radio§!: §YContact “Friends” in the EEMD§!

[zh.FOCUS_C08_OLD_FRIENDS]
旧日伙伴

[zh.FOCUS_C08_OLD_FRIENDS_desc]
最终决战之后，友谊学校遭到废弃，外族学生们被和煦光流赶出了小马利亚。既然我们有了电台，能否向以前的学生们发送信息，号召他们起来与我们一起反抗和煦光流呢？

[zh.FOCUS_C08_OLD_FRIENDS_TOOLTIP]
我们可以通过§Y星光电台§!联络以前友谊学院的学生，以及更多的朋友们\n解锁§Y星光电台§!中的决议：§Y联系友谊学校的学生们§!\n解锁§Y星光电台§!中的决议：§Y联络防区的“朋友”们§!

